WEBVTT

00:10.427 --> 00:11.636
I'm going…

00:12.554 --> 00:13.555
Nanami.

00:13.638 --> 00:15.140
I won't allow it.

00:15.223 --> 00:17.934
I told you the reason this morning.

00:19.144 --> 00:21.396
Now that they have put on the Veil,

00:21.479 --> 00:26.526
he's probably still alive
and in Satozakura High School now.

00:29.612 --> 00:33.908
I'll come right away.
Please be on standby, Itadori.

00:36.995 --> 00:39.039
I guess it's useless to say that.

00:41.041 --> 00:44.461
That's all.
I'll leave the rest to you, Ino.

00:44.544 --> 00:45.378
What?

00:46.629 --> 00:48.423
Is there a problem?

00:48.506 --> 00:51.426
No, but their numbers…

00:52.135 --> 00:53.803
There are too many of them.

00:54.637 --> 00:56.431
And they are all humans, right?

00:57.057 --> 01:01.770
I can recommend you to become
a Grade 1 Jujutsu Sorcerer.

01:05.732 --> 01:08.109
I'll do my best!

01:08.193 --> 01:10.653
All right!

01:13.698 --> 01:15.742
Step aside, Mr. Ijichi.

01:16.951 --> 01:19.621
Our job is to save people.

01:20.121 --> 01:23.625
That includes you, the students.

01:25.376 --> 01:28.421
I won't make the same mistake again.

01:30.381 --> 01:33.259
You can't go, Itadori.

01:36.638 --> 01:38.765
I'm sorry, Mr. Ijichi.

01:46.606 --> 01:49.818
What are you doing, Junpei?

01:52.821 --> 01:55.532
Step aside, Jujutsu Sorcerer.

03:37.175 --> 03:38.218
Moon Dregs!

03:44.474 --> 03:46.517
Jellyfish Shikigami?

03:46.601 --> 03:49.646
My attacks don't work
after he goes inside it!

03:51.022 --> 03:52.523
I'll repeat myself.

03:52.607 --> 03:54.734
Step aside, Jujutsu Sorcerer.

03:55.485 --> 03:57.237
This has nothing to do with you.

03:57.737 --> 04:00.281
That's not for you to decide!

04:00.782 --> 04:05.119
What's the point
of randomly saving people?

04:06.621 --> 04:08.456
Don't mistake…

04:08.539 --> 04:10.333
the value of life!

04:14.170 --> 04:18.508
The heart,
the so-called compassion by human beings,

04:18.591 --> 04:22.220
is just the metabolism of the soul,
and it's an illusion!

04:22.720 --> 04:25.807
Don't use illusive rules to restrain me.

04:26.432 --> 04:29.727
Those who deserve to die
shouldn't be spared.

04:29.811 --> 04:31.187
You have no right to stop me.

04:32.230 --> 04:33.773
Just sleep in there.

04:34.315 --> 04:36.276
I have work to do.

04:39.862 --> 04:41.614
Your cursed technique…

04:42.115 --> 04:43.324
is poison.

04:44.826 --> 04:46.995
The poison extracted
from your cursed energy

04:47.078 --> 04:49.622
is secreted through
the tentacles of Shikigami.

04:49.706 --> 04:53.584
The toxicity level, size, and strength
of the Shikigami can be changed.

04:53.668 --> 04:55.086
Just take your time to learn.

04:56.546 --> 04:59.549
It usually takes years for
Jujutsu Sorcerers to learn that skill,

04:59.632 --> 05:03.136
but I can teach you,
so you'll be able to fight soon.

05:04.804 --> 05:07.098
Junpei, you're truly talented.

05:10.143 --> 05:12.979
Who are you making excuses for?

05:33.541 --> 05:34.834
Why?

05:35.335 --> 05:37.462
Moon Dregs' poison is ineffective on him!

05:46.095 --> 05:48.181
Why must you hinder me?

05:48.264 --> 05:49.098
Why…

05:49.932 --> 05:51.225
Why…

05:52.477 --> 05:53.853
Why?

05:59.859 --> 06:02.361
He can't move in the air.

06:02.862 --> 06:06.032
If I want to crush him, I need to
strike him while he is in mid-air!

06:16.125 --> 06:18.503
I don't understand a single thing…

06:20.338 --> 06:22.465
you're saying, Junpei!

06:23.841 --> 06:26.302
Even if you said something
that quite makes sense.

06:27.678 --> 06:31.182
The best way to beat a Shikigami
is to go for the user.

06:32.475 --> 06:33.601
You just…

06:36.979 --> 06:39.774
want to think that you're right.

06:45.279 --> 06:46.989
I don't know your motives.

06:47.073 --> 06:48.950
You must have had a reason.

06:50.201 --> 06:51.035
However…

06:51.119 --> 06:53.121
Is it really…

06:53.746 --> 06:56.415
worth giving up that kind of life?

07:00.169 --> 07:02.713
You said the human heart is illusive.

07:03.256 --> 07:05.758
But could you say that to your mother?

07:07.093 --> 07:10.346
People don't have hearts…

07:10.430 --> 07:12.140
-You're still…
-They don't!

07:13.516 --> 07:14.809
Otherwise…

07:16.519 --> 07:17.728
Otherwise…

07:18.271 --> 07:20.022
Are you saying that my mother and I

07:20.523 --> 07:23.359
have been cursed by people with hearts?

07:25.403 --> 07:28.239
That's too much.

07:28.739 --> 07:34.495
I no longer know what's right and wrong.

07:42.962 --> 07:44.172
Why…

07:46.591 --> 07:48.176
Why didn't you evade it?

07:52.889 --> 07:54.098
I'm sorry.

07:54.765 --> 07:58.561
I didn't know anything,
but I said those things.

08:03.232 --> 08:05.109
Tell me what happened.

08:06.527 --> 08:10.406
I'll never curse you, Junpei.

08:11.657 --> 08:12.742
So…

08:20.041 --> 08:22.877
How could this be? Your mother…

08:29.217 --> 08:31.969
Junpei, come to Jujutsu High.

08:32.678 --> 08:34.889
We have very strong teachers

08:35.389 --> 08:37.850
and plenty of reliable comrades.

08:39.393 --> 08:40.978
If we work together,

08:41.479 --> 08:45.024
we can find the culprit
who cursed your mother.

08:45.650 --> 08:48.110
We will avenge her!

08:49.195 --> 08:50.655
Let's fight together!

08:53.950 --> 08:54.825
What?

08:56.285 --> 08:57.245
Who are you?

08:59.038 --> 09:00.581
What's with this guy?

09:02.124 --> 09:03.459
Is he a human?

09:04.043 --> 09:05.836
Nice to meet you.

09:06.420 --> 09:08.839
No, this sensation…

09:08.923 --> 09:10.800
Sukuna's vessel.

09:12.802 --> 09:14.178
Wait, Mahito!

09:18.516 --> 09:19.934
Am I an idiot?

09:20.017 --> 09:22.353
A human-looking Cursed Spirit
with a patchwork face…

09:22.436 --> 09:25.356
It's exactly the Cursed Spirit
that Nanami described!

09:25.940 --> 09:27.400
Run, Junpei!

09:28.067 --> 09:30.611
I don't know what
your relationship is with him,

09:30.695 --> 09:33.322
but run away now!

09:33.406 --> 09:34.407
Please!

09:34.991 --> 09:36.701
Calm down, Itadori.

09:37.243 --> 09:38.953
Mahito is not…

09:45.293 --> 09:47.712
A bad person.

09:52.592 --> 09:56.012
You know you're smart, right, Junpei?

09:57.513 --> 10:00.725
But sometimes, deliberation
can lead to more serious consequences

10:00.808 --> 10:02.393
than rash actions.

10:03.019 --> 10:05.021
You're the typical example.

10:06.272 --> 10:09.817
You're just as stupid as those

10:10.318 --> 10:12.737
you looked down on.

10:15.072 --> 10:17.491
And that's why you'll die.

10:19.076 --> 10:21.120
Idle Transfiguration.

10:30.338 --> 10:33.758
Come on, let's begin the second round!

10:34.342 --> 10:35.509
Junpei…

10:37.928 --> 10:39.180
Junpei!

10:40.014 --> 10:41.599
Snap out of it!

10:41.682 --> 10:43.434
I'll treat you now.

10:49.357 --> 10:50.483
Sukuna…

10:52.026 --> 10:53.861
Sukuna!

10:55.196 --> 10:56.280
What is it?

10:57.865 --> 10:59.450
I'll do anything!

10:59.533 --> 11:01.369
Do whatever you want with me!

11:01.452 --> 11:04.622
So please heal Junpei like how you…

11:04.705 --> 11:06.832
cured my heart back then!

11:07.875 --> 11:09.377
I refuse.

11:14.048 --> 11:15.716
Darn you.

11:18.552 --> 11:22.807
Good. He has forgotten
about our Binding Vow.

11:24.683 --> 11:26.519
I'm so happy!

11:26.602 --> 11:32.566
You gave up your pride and future.
You gave up everything to beg me.

11:34.068 --> 11:36.612
But you can't save anything.

11:36.695 --> 11:38.823
He rejected the Binding Vow?

11:39.532 --> 11:44.203
Although souls can't use
Reverse Cursed Technique to heal…

11:45.871 --> 11:48.207
Is he not good at treating others?

11:49.208 --> 11:50.626
You're so miserable.

11:50.709 --> 11:53.754
You're so miserable, brat.

11:55.548 --> 11:59.093
But this is just
the first step towards my goal, anyway.

11:59.176 --> 12:00.928
This is pretty good too.

12:18.529 --> 12:20.698
Oh, I see.

12:21.323 --> 12:22.283
In the end,

12:22.950 --> 12:24.452
they are nothing…

12:25.619 --> 12:27.037
but evil curses.

12:31.250 --> 12:34.628
Yuji…

12:42.511 --> 12:44.930
Why?

13:12.791 --> 13:13.918
He's dead already?

13:14.502 --> 13:17.546
I did transfigure him
a little too violently, after all.

13:20.132 --> 13:21.759
No wonder he's dead.

13:25.596 --> 13:27.348
That's some kind of strange attack.

13:27.431 --> 13:28.682
Interesting!

13:28.766 --> 13:31.268
Unfortunately, it doesn't work.

13:31.352 --> 13:33.646
As long as I maintain
the shape of my soul…

13:34.313 --> 13:35.314
What?

13:37.733 --> 13:39.360
What's happening?

13:42.279 --> 13:45.032
Even my soul got beaten up.

13:46.617 --> 13:47.868
Oh, right.

13:47.952 --> 13:50.621
Yuji Itadori is a vessel.

13:50.704 --> 13:55.209
There is another soul
that dwells inside his body.

13:56.001 --> 13:57.628
So naturally…

13:58.837 --> 14:00.548
Can you perceive it?

14:01.549 --> 14:03.509
The contours of my soul, that is!

14:10.766 --> 14:17.481
It's as if what I've said were all lies.

14:17.565 --> 14:19.650
My true intention is…

14:20.985 --> 14:23.112
I'll fucking kill you.

14:38.460 --> 14:41.130
Aren't you mistaking it for "exorcise"?

14:41.213 --> 14:42.506
Jujutsu Sorcerer.

14:45.676 --> 14:49.680
Yuji Itadori
has no regard for his own life.

14:49.763 --> 14:52.182
Geto doesn't allow me to use
an external Binding Vow

14:52.266 --> 14:54.560
such as taking hostages.

14:55.853 --> 15:00.441
Then if he meets someone he wants
to kill badly but is unable to,

15:00.524 --> 15:02.735
will he rely on Sukuna?

15:03.777 --> 15:05.613
If Junpei's death isn't enough,

15:05.696 --> 15:09.241
I'll just have to kill everyone
in this school.

15:09.909 --> 15:12.328
A hatred that transcends
his own interests will impose

15:12.411 --> 15:17.249
a Binding Vow on Yuji Itadori
in Sukuna's favor.

15:17.750 --> 15:22.129
It would be better if it increases
the chance of Sukuna joining us.

15:25.841 --> 15:30.512
But this means
I have to be stronger than him.

15:31.055 --> 15:32.598
And surprisingly, I'm up against…

15:33.682 --> 15:35.142
my mortal enemy.

15:54.536 --> 15:56.914
He keeps reshaping his soul.

15:56.997 --> 16:00.292
Should I not grapple him after a throw?

16:01.335 --> 16:03.587
Since his attack is effective,

16:03.671 --> 16:07.257
it's not a good idea to transform
my body to give him a bigger target.

16:08.592 --> 16:10.010
-In that case…
-In that case…

16:10.552 --> 16:13.305
I'll do it a hundred or thousand times.

16:14.473 --> 16:16.767
I'll continue to strike…

16:17.434 --> 16:19.520
until you're crushed!

16:20.771 --> 16:26.735
Let's change into
a streamlined form that's…

16:28.612 --> 16:29.863
optimal for killing!

16:55.973 --> 16:58.976
I'm sure you can't stretch forever.

17:16.744 --> 17:19.121
Normal people would have let go of it.

17:20.539 --> 17:22.666
If I extend my shape too wide,

17:22.750 --> 17:24.793
the operability
and strength will decrease.

17:49.818 --> 17:52.071
You can't beat me.

17:52.654 --> 17:54.490
Hurry up and switch.

17:56.283 --> 17:57.451
Switch to Sukuna.

17:59.578 --> 18:01.455
Idle Transfiguration.

18:09.505 --> 18:12.174
Did you just touch my soul?

18:12.674 --> 18:15.969
We both laughed at this brat
from the bottom of our hearts.

18:16.053 --> 18:17.679
I'll forgive you once.

18:18.722 --> 18:20.307
There's no second chance.

18:24.019 --> 18:25.729
Know your place…

18:27.606 --> 18:29.066
you fool.

18:35.114 --> 18:37.032
I'm not going to switch.

18:37.116 --> 18:38.575
I told you, didn't I?

18:40.744 --> 18:42.913
I'll fucking kill you.

19:18.407 --> 19:19.283
What?

19:26.582 --> 19:28.292
Oh, my.

19:28.876 --> 19:29.793
What?

19:31.086 --> 19:31.920
Nanami…

19:37.342 --> 19:38.844
I'll lecture you later.

19:39.511 --> 19:40.971
Report the situation first.

19:42.764 --> 19:45.767
I couldn't save them both.

19:46.602 --> 19:49.104
He's always thinking of others.

19:49.897 --> 19:52.316
How are you doing physically?

19:53.358 --> 19:54.776
I'm fine.

19:54.860 --> 19:56.945
I have a lot of holes, though.

19:57.905 --> 19:59.198
How is that fine?

19:59.698 --> 20:03.535
Also, everyone from the school
is unconscious in the gym.

20:04.494 --> 20:08.707
Hey. You look energetic, 7:3 Sorcerer.

20:09.374 --> 20:12.211
It's great that we're both doing well.

20:12.794 --> 20:14.421
Shall we hug…

20:15.214 --> 20:17.174
to celebrate our reunion?

20:23.138 --> 20:25.515
Itadori, why is his nose bleeding?

20:25.599 --> 20:26.642
What?

20:27.267 --> 20:28.810
I punched him.

20:28.894 --> 20:31.355
-When?
-At the very start.

20:31.438 --> 20:33.232
Did he touch you with his hand?

20:33.732 --> 20:34.608
Yes.

20:35.400 --> 20:38.111
My attacks have zero effect on him.

20:38.195 --> 20:40.113
What?

20:40.197 --> 20:42.824
-Why?
-The reason will come during the lecture.

20:43.700 --> 20:47.496
First, he may not be able
to use his ability on Itadori.

20:47.579 --> 20:50.707
Second, he has a reason
not to kill Itadori.

20:50.791 --> 20:53.001
Either way, it's an advantage.

20:53.502 --> 20:56.421
But I can stifle his movements.

20:57.673 --> 21:01.551
Let's create openings for each other
and take the opportunity to attack.

21:02.928 --> 21:05.472
We must exorcise him here.

21:07.891 --> 21:09.101
Okay!

22:41.026 --> 22:43.487
JUJU STROLL
